<title>GERMANY: VW reports H1 group profit, sales.</title>
<headline>VW reports H1 group profit, sales.</headline>
<dateline>WOLFSBURG, Germany 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				  56,550  vs 50,500</p>
<p>    Parent sales				 27,090  vs 25,860</p>
<p>    Group profit				 488     vs 282</p>
<p>    Parent profit				276     vs 230</p>
<p>    Group vehicle deliveries (units)     2,193,518 vs 1,995,560</p>
<p>    Group vehicle production (units)     2,207,408 vs 2,039,544</p>
<p>    Group vehicle sales (units)	    2,185,383 vs 2,014,502</p>
<p>    Group investment			   8,030   vs 7,920</p>
<p>    Group cash flow			    5,890   vs 5,000</p>
<p>    Group German vehicle sales (units)   511,088 vs 515,142</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German carmaker is Volkswagen AG, which sells vehicles under the brand names Volkswagen, Audi, Skoda and SEAT.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
